# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CampusBee — Client environment variables (loaded by Vite)
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill in real values.
# Only `VITE_*` variables are exposed to the browser.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Supabase (required) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=""
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""        # public anon key, safe for client

# ── MapMyIndia / Mappls (Phase 2+) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Sign up at https://www.mappls.com/api/  → "REST APIs" + "Map SDK".
# Create a Web App key with referrer restrictions for your domain(s).
VITE_MAPPLS_API_KEY=""                  # Map SDK & Places autocomplete (client)

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server-only secrets (DO NOT add to this file or `.env`)
# Set these via `supabase secrets set KEY=VALUE` for edge functions:
#
#   MAPPLS_REST_KEY            — Mappls REST API server key
#   SIGHTENGINE_API_USER       — Sightengine account user ID
#   SIGHTENGINE_API_SECRET     — Sightengine account secret
#   OPENAI_API_KEY             — OpenAI Moderation API key (free tier)
#
# Required by the `ai-moderate-content` edge function (Phase 3).
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
